[{:db/id "q-33988/selection/13a9486eeb40c188a8585ec18ad582cf5cb5eab63ba12c75ee09669f9e25bdc8" :answer/id #uuid "f133d3b6-1df8-5d6c-a6e1-4cc7271626f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(13,-20,31)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33988/selection/6a8dfa3b2e358faff4b82ea5a7c9554fa88955bb22a9bcd0f224b7107b426c35" :answer/id #uuid "be2cec85-34f3-5890-b64d-cb09a4374ed9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-20,13,31)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33988/selection/cbf25e020cc72c926cfab487b4b47da583f122af89c3cf9c350030468f86f3d7" :answer/id #uuid "0de8c113-3190-5840-8fb9-f5c7bb12f629" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-2,13,1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33988/selection/8a5738b426800ef3a549d17302d9718b0ca02ae61485c4e1dabda64e0294179c" :answer/id #uuid "c69d3d30-d776-59df-a2e8-50ce184ae06f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-20,31,13)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33988/selection/c8041c0b45c7624d574ce5092ae47ec9f4b5f3ba950a413ae68bb2ab9ecc7368" :answer/id #uuid "b5508fe3-d17e-5b82-bd8a-e33fc74d4104" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "No intersection" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33988/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f3f89eb7-32ce-58ab-af26-6895ea450c74" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-33988/selection/6a8dfa3b2e358faff4b82ea5a7c9554fa88955bb22a9bcd0f224b7107b426c35" :answer-field/choices ["q-33988/selection/13a9486eeb40c188a8585ec18ad582cf5cb5eab63ba12c75ee09669f9e25bdc8" "q-33988/selection/6a8dfa3b2e358faff4b82ea5a7c9554fa88955bb22a9bcd0f224b7107b426c35" "q-33988/selection/cbf25e020cc72c926cfab487b4b47da583f122af89c3cf9c350030468f86f3d7" "q-33988/selection/8a5738b426800ef3a549d17302d9718b0ca02ae61485c4e1dabda64e0294179c" "q-33988/selection/c8041c0b45c7624d574ce5092ae47ec9f4b5f3ba950a413ae68bb2ab9ecc7368"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-33988" :question/id #uuid "9e5fa2c2-85ce-5f18-afd6-dedce5453b43" :question/math-academy-id "q-33988" :question/problem "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:r=⟨5,3,-4⟩+t⟨-5,2,7⟩,\\,Π:r\\cdot ⟨2,3,1⟩=30.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's write the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=⟨5-5t,3+2t,-4+7t⟩.\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=⟨5-5t,3+2t,-4+7t⟩$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨2,3,1⟩ & =30 \\\\ ⟨5-5t,3+2t,-4+7t⟩\\cdot ⟨2,3,1⟩ & =30 \\\\ 2(5-5t)+3(3+2t)-4+7t & =30 \\\\ 10-10t+9+6t-4+7t & =30 \\\\ 3t & =15 \\\\ t & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P$ is obtained by substituting $t=5$ into the equation of the line, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p & =⟨5-5(5),3+2(5),-4+7(5)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-20,13,31⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the intersection point is $P(-20,13,31).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-33988/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abef3da6-252e-51e4-b816-9ef7233b9a5d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-33988"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-108313/selection/c8041c0b45c7624d574ce5092ae47ec9f4b5f3ba950a413ae68bb2ab9ecc7368" :answer/id #uuid "c6e8c10b-4c6c-548e-8a40-af66b3fc3888" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "No intersection" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-108313/selection/1ff47214566a043a5a05b5abde4966138fb2aeed255fd2b9d9a8dd5e94b8de61" :answer/id #uuid "ad1f5c5e-9bfc-542f-b83d-9cd12da5c2e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-7,4,-9)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-108313/selection/5f9fb785527fe80729dcf456bb35ecb4516c5eea1433727afafc9de13863e3c5" :answer/id #uuid "9a0767ba-c8fe-5d02-98cb-a2daad8cd428" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-2,2,-5)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-108313/selection/8444c66eaf313c1a84621d24883ed41397058d8f2fd65dcdfd6f7ec7cd2384d0" :answer/id #uuid "b90c5c3a-2f79-5901-856b-ccae222540c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(8,-2,3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-108313/selection/517d0b7750c7ed7578dd3e9c54d9600b086ab960bd9fb9575bfb1ec53fb71546" :answer/id #uuid "031f0ab7-98e5-5ef1-b694-26f424e0c1fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(3,0,-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-108313/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5bd20147-884b-5aad-8617-b8c00cdeb58e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-108313/selection/1ff47214566a043a5a05b5abde4966138fb2aeed255fd2b9d9a8dd5e94b8de61" :answer-field/choices ["q-108313/selection/c8041c0b45c7624d574ce5092ae47ec9f4b5f3ba950a413ae68bb2ab9ecc7368" "q-108313/selection/1ff47214566a043a5a05b5abde4966138fb2aeed255fd2b9d9a8dd5e94b8de61" "q-108313/selection/5f9fb785527fe80729dcf456bb35ecb4516c5eea1433727afafc9de13863e3c5" "q-108313/selection/8444c66eaf313c1a84621d24883ed41397058d8f2fd65dcdfd6f7ec7cd2384d0" "q-108313/selection/517d0b7750c7ed7578dd3e9c54d9600b086ab960bd9fb9575bfb1ec53fb71546"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-108313" :question/id #uuid "aae7d446-6165-5274-a5d2-5622980a25ee" :question/math-academy-id "q-108313" :question/problem "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:r=⟨3,0,-1⟩+t⟨5,-2,4⟩,\\,Π:r\\cdot ⟨0,1,-2⟩=22.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's write the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=⟨3+5t,-2t,-1+4t⟩.\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=⟨3+5t,-2t,-1+4t⟩$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨0,1,-2⟩ & =22 \\\\ ⟨3+5t,-2t,-1+4t⟩\\cdot ⟨0,1,-2⟩ & =22 \\\\ 0(3+5t)+1(-2t)+(-2)(-1+4t) & =22 \\\\ -2t+2-8t & =22 \\\\ -10t & =20 \\\\ t & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P$ is obtained by substituting $t=-2$ into the equation of the line, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p & =⟨3+5(-2),-2(-2),-1+4(-2)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-7,4,-9⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the intersection point is $P(-7,4,-9).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-108313/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abef3da6-252e-51e4-b816-9ef7233b9a5d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-108313"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73987/selection/c6975e5044b07c7f06b793f5798ef5c48e8430da6f58b591153fcd92d2107d87" :answer/id #uuid "a4284848-979c-5fae-989a-3cd17ed040d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-9,-3,9)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73987/selection/d6312c6dc9ebba1aeb77422a3abd17fd154e44e55017eaaba3a99f1c892a90ae" :answer/id #uuid "e49af1b9-e47a-5fee-a40d-19324bedec52" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-9,-3,3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73987/selection/f1c89e203e25701a1c93accc19340aa45396b377d98a3f70adca9f32dced1b27" :answer/id #uuid "14aea272-0f72-538a-9340-815fdbcd24ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-6,-3,6)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73987/selection/3c49a45ad91374e2159b87d6fe1ad16f9170fb589c45cf1c02859108b5661f64" :answer/id #uuid "63533bfb-1aaf-53a5-bce6-0a04e315530b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-3,-3,9)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73987/selection/c8041c0b45c7624d574ce5092ae47ec9f4b5f3ba950a413ae68bb2ab9ecc7368" :answer/id #uuid "9ea3d7cc-1f42-5183-b17e-629a43310bde" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "No intersection" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73987/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8f7137c2-9897-5ea1-92cf-de9f34c1bf13" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73987/selection/c6975e5044b07c7f06b793f5798ef5c48e8430da6f58b591153fcd92d2107d87" :answer-field/choices ["q-73987/selection/c6975e5044b07c7f06b793f5798ef5c48e8430da6f58b591153fcd92d2107d87" "q-73987/selection/d6312c6dc9ebba1aeb77422a3abd17fd154e44e55017eaaba3a99f1c892a90ae" "q-73987/selection/f1c89e203e25701a1c93accc19340aa45396b377d98a3f70adca9f32dced1b27" "q-73987/selection/3c49a45ad91374e2159b87d6fe1ad16f9170fb589c45cf1c02859108b5661f64" "q-73987/selection/c8041c0b45c7624d574ce5092ae47ec9f4b5f3ba950a413ae68bb2ab9ecc7368"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73987" :question/id #uuid "eb2bf85c-9bb4-5c89-8fe8-0cc8aac7e5a4" :question/math-academy-id "q-73987" :question/problem "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:r=⟨1,1,1⟩+t⟨5,2,-4⟩,\\,Π:r\\cdot ⟨2,-3,5⟩=36.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's write the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=⟨1+5t,1+2t,1-4t⟩.\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=⟨1+5t,1+2t,1-4t⟩$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨2,-3,5⟩ & =36 \\\\ ⟨1+5t,1+2t,1-4t⟩\\cdot ⟨2,-3,5⟩ & =36 \\\\ 2(1+5t)-3(1+2t)+5(1-4t) & =36 \\\\ 2+10t-3-6t+5-20t & =36 \\\\ -16t & =32 \\\\ t & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P$ is obtained by substituting $t=-2$ into the equation of the line, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p & =⟨1+5(-2),1+2(-2),1-4(-2)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-9,-3,9⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the intersection point is $P(-9,-3,9).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-73987/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abef3da6-252e-51e4-b816-9ef7233b9a5d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73987"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73984/selection/3f24f131a150708138ca8acd8503efa82b87c241bb28046399664c704169f23d" :answer/id #uuid "fbe0c409-6b66-5562-8460-88b49d1631e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-5,-6,0)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73984/selection/c757f5d6fdbebbc6abdaecbecbdee4ecd6445f38655a44141aa29d3cb05372ec" :answer/id #uuid "b4cd441e-6b76-5604-b488-9f2f7b982c57" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(3,-6,7)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73984/selection/cb9e