 7 & =-24 \\\\ -18+30t+10-30t+28 & =-24 \\\\ 20 & =-24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation has no solution. Therefore, we conclude that the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ do not intersect." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-73984/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abef3da6-252e-51e4-b816-9ef7233b9a5d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73984"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-108311/selection/c8041c0b45c7624d574ce5092ae47ec9f4b5f3ba950a413ae68bb2ab9ecc7368" :answer/id #uuid "eac8ebca-c530-5195-acb2-b6292ade13da" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "No intersection" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-108311/selection/ef1fd0eff064a9a3a88e965f10eeb1ec1446a1ec7b33a811dc3f8a9b5811250f" :answer/id #uuid "4f6b7658-2157-5f1b-b131-5b91d1e140f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5,-8,5)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-108311/selection/acbb6cc2ef084b8a2bcd9cb3be9d153e7933146283b7687a359b6370053614e1" :answer/id #uuid "8d6729de-aff7-5c4c-98ad-1bb06eb79a23" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5,-2,3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-108311/selection/0963cee92aa49c6d1277bb2d56b0369b75458b7f019bde48356828eb068a3838" :answer/id #uuid "5ff1b670-d9ce-578f-abed-beb705375599" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5,1,2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-108311/selection/0ba34e51189ee21b1eb66ad3d85bbedf148421d0d5642011d3cfdc4a9b514efc" :answer/id #uuid "c2f5a6ad-f90e-57b3-9d8a-f1d55a9c1f3e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5,-5,4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-108311/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2f06fdb5-06f0-5457-8b29-4b3079bc722a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-108311/selection/acbb6cc2ef084b8a2bcd9cb3be9d153e7933146283b7687a359b6370053614e1" :answer-field/choices ["q-108311/selection/c8041c0b45c7624d574ce5092ae47ec9f4b5f3ba950a413ae68bb2ab9ecc7368" "q-108311/selection/ef1fd0eff064a9a3a88e965f10eeb1ec1446a1ec7b33a811dc3f8a9b5811250f" "q-108311/selection/acbb6cc2ef084b8a2bcd9cb3be9d153e7933146283b7687a359b6370053614e1" "q-108311/selection/0963cee92aa49c6d1277bb2d56b0369b75458b7f019bde48356828eb068a3838" "q-108311/selection/0ba34e51189ee21b1eb66ad3d85bbedf148421d0d5642011d3cfdc4a9b514efc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-108311" :question/id #uuid "8d28c265-18d6-5656-afcf-7f8222829274" :question/math-academy-id "q-108311" :question/problem "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:r=⟨5,-2,3⟩+t⟨0,3,-1⟩,\\,Π:r\\cdot ⟨1,3,-2⟩=-7.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's write the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=⟨5,-2+3t,3-t⟩.\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=⟨5,-2+3t,3-t⟩$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨1,3,-2⟩ & =-7 \\\\ ⟨5,-2+3t,3-t⟩\\cdot ⟨1,3,-2⟩ & =-7 \\\\ 5+3(-2+3t)+(-2)(3-t) & =-7 \\\\ 5-6+9t-6+2t & =-7 \\\\ 11t & =0 \\\\ t & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P$ is obtained by substituting $t=0$ into the equation of the line, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p & =⟨5,-2+3(0),3-0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨5,-2,3⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the intersection point is $P(5,-2,3).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-108311/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abef3da6-252e-51e4-b816-9ef7233b9a5d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-108311"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-74003/selection/b5bb6679c2a97fe23265cc28d1b5a443cc8718a486a73be30255c1f2f161dd74" :answer/id #uuid "5f9408c3-0eb4-5b30-8808-98420723e10f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(1,12,-18)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74003/selection/9ac014d4ae78a204c59e621c9a8e72f14574e2f9232bd37535a309cb8251a68b" :answer/id #uuid "5cdda2c9-4fe5-5bb2-9519-342c31cd32ad" :ans