of the plane immediately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x+6y-3z-130 & =0 \\\\ 4(5-t)+6(4+2t)-3(-6-3t) & =130 \\\\ 20-4t+24+12t+18+9t & =130 \\\\ 17t & =68 \\\\ t & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo get the position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P$, we substitute $t=4$ into the parametric equations of the line:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x=5-4=1 \\\\ y=4+2(4)=12 \\\\ z=-6-3(4)=-18\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the intersection point is  $P(1,12,-18).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-74003/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "82e761b5-ec1c-549d-b726-e0909cfe460b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74003"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73993/selection/989a6cff199d10dfb1be478dbe50852d284280e639cea52eeabd81f356cc79fe" :answer/id #uuid "09fde5db-22e0-5375-bf7a-30854d8d9851" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(18,8,12)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73993/selection/c8041c0b45c7624d574ce5092ae47ec9f4b5f3ba950a413ae68bb2ab9ecc7368" :answer/id #uuid "d6385c11-cd80-5693-b906-783769c98896" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "No intersection" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73993/selection/765b4a259da1f6cb4235e0c77791265a74528c4e0f18f4eafd0cfe5510276a91" :answer/id #uuid "2699e9b5-cdb9-5d08-af40-101189a9fe62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(19,10,16)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73993/selection/95dbd9aa2037560f91036e32322a0293a7c968d80461c363d51cc86117e073b2" :answer/id #uuid "5d516cd8-dadb-5457-b33b-e27837b4fcd8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(8,-1,6)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73993/selection/8ca74e480312b56ed03935c0d55c8734e5c27124fa5293585ee937b9e61ad1e4" :answer/id #uuid "1b15c630-a693-5679-819b-eea883f61546" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(18,11,16)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73993/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0c554705-9568-55b3-99b7-44461a69d